---
layout: base.njk
title: "Sitemap — Camwyn & Co."
description: "Complete table of contents, dispatches, adventure compass archetypes, and architectural specifications for Camwyn & Co."
permalink: "/sitemap/index.html"
---

<!-- Structured Data (JSON-LD WebPage) -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Sitemap — Camwyn & Co.",
  "description": "Complete table of contents, dispatches, adventure compass archetypes, and architectural specifications for Camwyn & Co.",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/sitemap/",
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
    "url": "{{ site.url }}"
  }
}
</script>

<section class="u-py-section" aria-labelledby="sitemap-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    
    <!-- Hero / Header -->
    <div class="c-colophon-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl);">
      <div>
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Table of Contents &amp; Navigation Map</p>
        <h1 id="sitemap-heading" class="c-hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom: 0;">
          Sitemap.
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="c-hero__lead" style="font-size: 1.125rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-top: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: 0;">
          An architectural directory of all pages, field notes, creative archetypes, and machine-readable feeds across Camwyn &amp; Co.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1: Core Journey & Foundation -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl); padding-top: var(--space-xl); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
      <div class="c-colophon-section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">01 · Essential Landmarks</p>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Core Journey &amp; Foundation
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            The primary rooms of our digital workshop—our point of view, our working dynamic, operating ventures, and the open door for new collaborations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-specimen-grid">
        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">01 · Home</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">The Workshop &amp; Hearth ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Introduction to Camwyn &amp; Co., recent operating notes, and the interactive Adventure Compass.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">02 · Story</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/our-story/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Our Story ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Stephen and Ivy Page—how curiosity, family, and complementary brains shaped our way of building.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">03 · Work</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/what-we-do/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">What We Do ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Operating ventures under our roof—Mema's Inclination, Field Protocols, and Collaborative Initiatives.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">04 · Dispatches</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/notes/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Notes from the Field ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Our searchable archive of dispatches, workbench reflections, and table stories.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">05 · Collaboration</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/the-next-thing/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">The Next Thing ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            A permanent open door for worthwhile adventures, new ideas, and complementary partnerships.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">06 · Interactive</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/compass/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Adventure Compass &amp; Chemistry ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            The 5-question discovery quiz and full 15-pairing collaborative chemistry matrix at the Workshop Table.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: Adventure Compass Archetype Profiles -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl); padding-top: var(--space-xl); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
      <div class="c-colophon-section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">02 · Creative Archetypes</p>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Adventure Compass Profiles
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Direct landing profiles and personalized share cards for each of the six creative archetypes discovered through the Compass.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-specimen-grid">
        {% for archKey, arch in compass.archetypes %}
          <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">
              <img src="/assets/{{ arch.icon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" />
              <span class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase;">{{ arch.dispatchTag }}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-primary);">
              <a href="/compass/{{ arch.id }}/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">{{ arch.name }} ↗</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay); margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); line-height: 1.4;">
              {{ arch.gift }}
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
              {{ arch.tagline }}
            </p>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3: Notes from the Field (Chronological Index) -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl); padding-top: var(--space-xl); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
      <div class="c-colophon-section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">03 · Published Dispatches</p>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Field Notes Archive
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            All {{ collections.notes.length }} published essays, technical architectures, and kitchen-table reflections arranged chronologically.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm);">
        {% for note in collections.notes %}
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-sm); padding: var(--space-md); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 280px;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
                <img src="/assets/{{ note.data.archetype | archetypeIcon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" />
                <span class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.6875rem; text-transform: uppercase;">
                  {{ note.data.archetype | archetypeTag }}
                </span>
                <span style="color: var(--color-outline); font-size: 0.75rem;">·</span>
                <time datetime="{{ note.date | htmlDateString }}" class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-outline-dark);">
                  {{ note.date | readableDate }}
                </time>
              </div>
              <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0; color: var(--color-primary);">
                <a href="{{ note.url }}" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">
                  {{ note.data.title }} ↗
                </a>
              </h3>
              {% if note.data.excerpt %}
                <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-top: 0.25rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
                  {{ note.data.excerpt }}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-outline-dark); white-space: nowrap;">
              {{ note.templateContent | readingTime }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4: Specifications, Feeds & Legal -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl); padding-top: var(--space-xl); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
      <div class="c-colophon-section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">04 · Atelier &amp; Syndication</p>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Specifications &amp; Machine Feeds
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Colophon documentation, syndication endpoints, machine-readable search indexes, and privacy commitments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-specimen-grid">
        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Documentation</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/colophon/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Colophon &amp; Spec ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            The typography scale, OCSS design tokens, and construction principles behind the site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">RSS / Atom</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/feed.xml" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Atom Feed (feed.xml) ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Full-text syndication feed for RSS and Atom readers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">XML Sitemap</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/sitemap.xml" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">XML Sitemap (sitemap.xml) ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Standard XML sitemap protocol for web search crawlers with priority weights and change intervals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">JSON Index</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/search-index.json" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Search Index (JSON) ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Client-side static search index containing full-text dispatches and archetype metadata.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Policy</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/privacy/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Privacy Policy ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Zero tracking cookies, local-first browser state, and complete respect for your data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="c-specimen-card c-specimen-card--alt">
          <div class="u-font-mono u-text-clay-accessible" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Terms</div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">
            <a href="/terms/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-muted-clay);">Terms of Use ↗</a>
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Simple rules for a quiet, human-scale digital space built on respect and care.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
